### TaxRateSystem - profile + notification smoke tests (API.md §7, §11, §17 Flow 6)
### Requires a bearer token: run http/auth.http first.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### §7.1 - the caller's full profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### §7.2 - partial update: absent fields stay, explicit nulls clear phone/gender/dateOfBirth
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Juan Miguel", "phoneNumber": "09179876543" }

### §7.2 - clearing the optional fields (409 phone conflict; 422 invalid values)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phoneNumber": null, "gender": null, "dateOfBirth": null }

### §7.3 - create or replace the single address (full replace, not a patch)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/address
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "street": "123 Rizal Avenue",
  "barangay": "Barangay 1",
  "city": "Manila",
  "province": "Metro Manila",
  "postalCode": "1000"
}

### §7.4 - change the password (200; every other session is signed out)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "SecurePassword123",
  "newPassword": "SecurePassword456",
  "confirmPassword": "SecurePassword456"
}

### §7.5/§11.1 - the three notification switches
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/notification-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### §7.6/§11.2 - persist the full switch set (all three required)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/notification-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taxUpdates": true, "calculationReminders": true, "generalNotifications": false }

